  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are always ready with more tactics.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Practiced Tactician<sup>APG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can expend one use of mythic power to restore a number of uses per day of the tactician class feature equal to your mythic tier. You may never have more than your maximum uses per day.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc16\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
